  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct Chocolate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chocolatemakers is a premium organic chocolate manufacturer from bean to bar. The Chocolatemakers focus on quality and sustainability and have a direct relation with the cocoa farmer communities and cooperatives. The DGGF-TA project allowed them to develop new origins, open new markets for farmer groups and develop new markets for their products (cocoa beans and cocoa liquor as well). During the course of the project Colombia became a new origin and the Chocolatemakers have started a new product line, called &#x2018;Pure Love&#x2019;. The purchased cocoa comes from different plantations and has been processed at the farms itself, it can therefore be sold with the name of the female farmers responsible for the production. So far 48 FTE have been created during the course of the project and 73 people have been trained.</narrative>
  </description>
